{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260522_201413_price_sensitive_student", "persona_id": "price_sensitive_student", "outcome": "TIMEOUT", "content": "面对价格敏感用户，必须在第一轮直接回应价格，否则用户会认为你在隐瞒，导致信任崩塌。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260522_201511"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260522_201413_price_sensitive_student", "persona_id": "price_sensitive_student", "outcome": "TIMEOUT", "content": "当用户提及竞品时，立即进行差异化对比，突出自身产品的独特价值（如性能、售后），而非回避或反问。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260522_201511"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260522_201413_price_sensitive_student", "persona_id": "price_sensitive_student", "outcome": "TIMEOUT", "content": "对于预算刚性用户，如果产品价格超出预算，应主动提供更低配置的替代方案，而非仅靠分期和赠品。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260522_201511"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260522_201413_price_sensitive_student", "persona_id": "price_sensitive_student", "outcome": "TIMEOUT", "content": "在用户多次重复同一问题时，必须意识到这是核心异议，立即正面解决，否则对话将陷入僵局。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260522_201511"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260522_201413_price_sensitive_student", "persona_id": "price_sensitive_student", "outcome": "TIMEOUT", "content": "使用分期和赠品时，需配合价格让步（如折扣）才能有效打动价格敏感用户，单独使用效果有限。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260522_201511"}
{"type": "reusable_tactic", "session_id": "session_20260522_201413_price_sensitive_student", "persona_id": "price_sensitive_student", "outcome": "TIMEOUT", "name": "直接报价法", "condition": "用户首次询问价格时，无论是否了解需求，都应直接报价，避免回避。", "example": "用户：多少钱？销冠：这款是2999元，学生优惠后2799元。", "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260522_201511"}
{"type": "reusable_tactic", "session_id": "session_20260522_201413_price_sensitive_student", "persona_id": "price_sensitive_student", "outcome": "TIMEOUT", "name": "竞品差异化对比法", "condition": "用户提及竞品时，立即从用户痛点出发对比关键差异点，并量化价值。", "example": "用户：华为平板更便宜。销冠：是的，但我们的手写延迟低16ms，记笔记更流畅，而且AI整理笔记功能能帮你节省时间。", "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260522_201511"}
{"type": "reusable_tactic", "session_id": "session_20260522_201413_price_sensitive_student", "persona_id": "price_sensitive_student", "outcome": "TIMEOUT", "name": "预算内替代方案法", "condition": "用户预算低于产品价格时，主动提供更低配置的型号或套餐，而非仅靠分期。", "example": "用户：我预算只有2500。销冠：那您可以看看这款青春版，价格2499元，核心功能一样，只是存储小一点。", "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260522_201511"}
{"type": "rebuttal_template", "session_id": "session_20260522_201413_price_sensitive_student", "persona_id": "price_sensitive_student", "outcome": "TIMEOUT", "objection": "价格太贵，超出预算", "rebuttal_template": "理解您的预算限制。我们还有一款[型号B]，价格[价格]元，完全在您的预算内。虽然[功能差异]，但核心学习功能一样强大，而且同样享受[学生优惠/赠品]。您看要不要先了解一下？", "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260522_201511"}
{"type": "rebuttal_template", "session_id": "session_20260522_201413_price_sensitive_student", "persona_id": "price_sensitive_student", "outcome": "TIMEOUT", "objection": "竞品更便宜", "rebuttal_template": "您说得对，华为那款价格确实更低。不过我们这款在[关键差异点，如手写延迟、AI功能、售后]上优势明显，比如手写延迟9ms vs 25ms，记笔记体验完全不同。而且我们提供两年质保和一次免费换屏，长期用更省心。您觉得这些功能对您来说值不值多花[差价]？", "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260522_201511"}
{"type": "rebuttal_template", "session_id": "session_20260522_201413_price_sensitive_student", "persona_id": "price_sensitive_student", "outcome": "TIMEOUT", "objection": "学生优惠力度不够", "rebuttal_template": "我理解您希望更优惠。除了学生价，如果您今天能定，我可以帮您申请一个额外的[具体优惠，如赠品或折扣]，相当于再省[金额]。另外还可以12期免息，每月只需[金额]元，完全不影响生活费。您看这样能接受吗？", "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260522_201511"}
